                "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e8e8;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:28px;\"><div><p style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000;margin:0 0 8px;\">OTHER SERVICES</p><div style=\"width:28px;height:2px;background:#000;\"></div></div><a href=\"/product-category/other-services/\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#000;text-decoration:none;\">See All →</a></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;\"><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;background:#000;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;\"><svg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z'/><path d='M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5'/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;\">Drone Training</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#707070;line-height:1.65;margin:0;\">Professional flight training for beginners to advanced pilots. Get certified and fly with confidence.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;background:#000;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;\"><svg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polygon points='3 11 22 2 13 21 11 13 3 11'/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;\">Aerial Survey</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#707070;line-height:1.65;margin:0;\">High-resolution aerial surveys for construction, agriculture, and real estate projects.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;background:#000;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;\"><svg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polygon points='1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6'/><line x1='8' y1='2' x2='8' y2='18'/><line x1='16' y1='6' x2='16' y2='22'/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;\">3D Mapping</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#707070;line-height:1.65;margin:0;\">Precise 3D photogrammetry mapping for GIS, land development, and urban planning.</p></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8e8e8;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 24px;\"><div style=\"width:52px;height:52px;background:#000;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px;\"><svg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z'/></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;\">Consultation</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#707070;line-height:1.65;margin:0;\">Expert drone consulting for businesses integrating drone technology into their workflow.</p></div></div>"
